nThe releases are signed using [minisign](https://jedisct1.github.io/minisign/). The public key is available on [my website](https://bsago.me/contact). I just realised I should make it available over DNS somehow.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2020-11-07 at 12 39 27](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/503760/98441447-482ec380-20f6-11eb-8b6f-8c25368b661f.png)\r\n","reactions":{"total_count":26,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":6,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1}}
